<title>USA: Colonial Bank completes bank mergers.</title>
<headline>Colonial Bank completes bank mergers.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup said Friday it had completed mergers with two banks, increasing its total assets to more than $5.3 billion.</p>
<p>It said it had merged with Tomoka State Bank in Ormond Beach, Fla., and Jefferson Bank of Miami Beach, Fla.</p>
<p>Tomoka State had $71.5 million in assets and Jefferson $458.5 million, it added.</p>
<p>Colonial BancGroup is a bank holding company based in Montgomery, Ala.</p>
</text>
